The hotel's online booking platform now features an AI-driven recommendation engine that suggests room upgrades and local experiences based on previous guest preferences. This system analyzes past bookings and browsing history to offer personalized suggestions. Guests can opt out of personalized recommendations in their account settings.

Here is an example of the data structure used by the recommendation engine:
```json
{
  "guest_id": "12345",
  "preferences": {
    "room_type": "suite",
    "amenities": ["spa", "ocean_view"]
  },
  "suggestions": [
    {"type": "room_upgrade", "description": "Deluxe Suite with balcony"},
    {"type": "activity", "description": "Guided hiking tour"}
  ]
}
```

The system is designed to enhance the guest experience while respecting privacy preferences. Feedback can be provided through the app.
